sieve-filter-v1
; A test of `padding trailing` and `within`: the toy grammar with cut edges, two separators (SPACE
; and q, so the symbols past `within` have two choices each), trailing padding, and the words held
; to the first `room` symbols. Not shipped: CI checks the engine against the oracle with it.
id        toy-padding-whole
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  A toy grammar with two separators and trailing padding (whole edges).

tokens    separator " " "q"
edges     whole
padding   trailing
set       det   list:det.txt
set       adj   list:adj.txt
set       noun  list:noun.txt
set       verb  list:verb.txt
follow    det   adj
follow    det   noun
follow    adj   adj
follow    adj   noun
follow    noun  verb
follow    verb  det
follow    verb  noun
first     det noun
last      noun verb
end
